---
/* ABOUT PAGE - san serif
  Independent studio biography and philosophy.
  Asset: public/images/fuji.png
*/
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | san serif" description="san serif is a Sydney-based independent studio building high-utility, Apple-native tools for language learning, named after 山 (san), the character for mountain.">
	<main class="wrapper">

		<section class="bio">
			<header class="hero-header">
				<img src="/images/fuji.png" alt="Mt Fuji Sketch" class="fuji-bg" />
				<h1>san serif</h1>
			</header>

			<div class="content">
				<p>
					The name <strong>san</strong> comes from the character <strong>山 (san)</strong> meaning “mountain”. It serves as a reminder of the discipline required when navigating the complexities of Japanese, Korean, and Chinese.
				</p>
				
				<p>
					Based in Sydney, san serif is an independent studio focused on building high-utility tools for language learning and culture. It grew out of a gap we saw in language learning apps. Every product here starts with human-computer interaction principles, not a features list. Each is built to remove friction and support consistent, deliberate progress.
				</p>

				<div class="divider"></div>

				<div class="philosophy-section">
					<h3>Ikigai <a href={`kaku://new?text=${encodeURIComponent('生きがい')}`} class="ikigai-link">生きがい</a></h3>
					<p>
						Ikigai is a Japanese concept meaning a reason for being. Our ikigai is building user-friendly, Apple-native tools for language learning. Minimal friction. Long-term retention.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="divider"></div>

				<div class="footer-bio">
					<p>Building tools for the journey</p>
					<div class="footer-links">
						<a href="/support" class="text-link">Support</a>
						<a href="https://x.com/sanserif_studio" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-link" title="Follow on X">
							<img src="/logo-black.png" alt="X Logo" class="x-icon" />
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	/* --- LAYOUT CONFIG --- */
	.wrapper { 
		max-width: 850px; 
		margin: 0 auto; 
		padding: 20px 20px 80px; 
	}

	/* --- HERO / MOUNTAIN SECTION --- */
	.hero-header {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column; 
		align-items: flex-start;
		margin-bottom: 60px;
	}

	.fuji-bg {
		width: 480px;
		opacity: 1;
		filter: grayscale(100%);
		mix-blend-mode: multiply; 
		margin-top: -30px; 
		margin-left: -20px;
		margin-bottom: 15px; 
		pointer-events: none; 
		user-select: none;
	}
	
	/* --- TYPOGRAPHY --- */
	h1 { 
		font-size: 3.2rem; 
		font-weight: 700; 
		letter-spacing: -0.04em; 
		margin: 0;
		color: #000;
	}
	
	.content p { 
		font-size: 1.1rem; 
		line-height: 1.7; 
		color: #333; 
		margin-bottom: 2rem; 
	}
	
	.content strong { font-weight: 600; color: #000; }
	
	/* --- DECORATIVE --- */
	.divider { height: 1px; background: #eee; margin: 50px 0; }
	.philosophy-section { max-width: 600px; }

	h3 {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
		color: #000;
		margin-bottom: 15px;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.ikigai-link {
		color: inherit;
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-decoration-color: #ccc;
		text-underline-offset: 3px;
		transition: text-decoration-color 0.15s;
	}

	.ikigai-link:hover { text-decoration-color: #000; }
	
	.philosophy-section p { font-size: 1rem; color: #555; line-height: 1.6; }
	
	/* --- FOOTER / SOCIAL --- */
	.footer-bio {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.footer-bio p {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: #bbb;
		letter-spacing: 0.02em;
		font-weight: 500;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.footer-links {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 20px;
	}

	.text-link {
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: #999;
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-decoration-color: #ccc;
		text-underline-offset: 3px;
		transition: text-decoration-color 0.15s, color 0.15s;
	}

	.text-link:hover {
		color: #000;
		text-decoration-color: #000;
	}

	.social-link {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.x-icon {
		/* SHRUNK: Smaller footprint to match text height */
		width: 14px;
		height: 14px;
		opacity: 1; 
		transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
	}

	.social-link:hover .x-icon {
		opacity: 1; 
	}

	/* --- RESPONSIVE --- */
	@media (max-width: 700px) {
		.wrapper { padding-top: 10px; }
		h1 { font-size: 2.6rem; }
		.fuji-bg {
			width: 100%;
			max-width: 400px;
			margin-top: -10px;
			margin-bottom: 10px; 
		}
	}
</style>